```
Also present: `findByLastNameIgnoreCase`, `countByCity`, `countByRegistrationDate`, `countByHouseholdId`, `save`, `findById`, etc.

There are **three implementations**, all of which must gain a parallel `existsByEmail`-style method:
- Spring Data JPA: `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/repository/springdatajpa/SpringDataOwnerRepository.java` — `@Override boolean existsByTelephone(String telephone);` (derived query; note `countByCity` uses `@Query("... WHERE LOWER(owner.city) = LOWER(:city)")`, the case-insensitive idiom you'd want for email).
