- JDBC: `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/repository/jdbc/JdbcOwnerRepositoryImpl.java` (line 153) — `SELECT COUNT(*) FROM owners WHERE telephone = :telephone`.

The active profile picks which impl is used (`@Profile("spring-data-jpa")` / `"jpa"` / `"jdbc"`).

### 3. Service layer
Interface: `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/service/ClinicService.java`
Impl: `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/service/ClinicServiceImpl.java`

